Databricks: Complete Topics for Data Analysis
Databricks is a cloud-based data and AI platform used for data engineering, data analysis,
  data science, and machine learning. If you want to become a Data Analyst using Databricks, 
focus on SQL, Python, PySpark, data transformation, Delta Lake, data visualization, 
and performance optimization.
Below is a complete learning roadmap, from beginner to advanced, with the topics commonly 
  needed for data analyst roles.
