Medallion architecture
Bronze — Raw data
Ingest source data with minimal changes; preserve the original information.
Silver — Cleaned data
Clean records, remove duplicates, validate types and join related datasets.
Gold — Business-ready data
Create aggregated tables, business metrics, reporting datasets and KPI summaries.
Example: Raw sales files → cleaned sales transactions → monthly revenue by product and region.
This architecture is a common Databricks design pattern, not a requirement for every project.
