Example of a monthly sales analysis query:
sql
SELECT
    DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', order_date) AS sales_month,
    region,
    SUM(sales_amount) AS total_sales,
    COUNT(DISTINCT order_id) AS total_orders,
    AVG(sales_amount) AS average_order_value
FROM gold_sales
WHERE order_status = 'Completed'
GROUP BY
    DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', order_date),
    region
ORDER BY sales_month, region;
Practice writing queries independently and explaining what each result means for the business.
